<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>The way that God has planned</l><l>To labor on the land</l><l>Is “Amen, Lord! Amen, Lord! Amen to Your Word!”</l><l>Whene’er He speaks today,</l><l>Whatever He may say,</l><l>It’s “Amen, Lord! Amen, Lord! Amen to Your Word!”</l><l>On to victory! On to victory!</l><l>Cries our great Commander—On!</l><l>We’ll move at His command</l><l>And now possess the land</l><l>By “Amen, Lord! Amen, Lord! Amen to Your Word!”</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>The Lord has also shown</l><l>The land we’ll fully own</l><l>By following, following, following the church.</l><l>Where’er the Body goes,</l><l>Howe’er the Spirit flows,</l><l>It’s following, following, following the church.</l><l>On to victory! On to victory!</l><l>Cries our great Commander—On!</l><l>We’ll move at His command</l><l>And now possess the land</l><l>By following, following, following the church.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
